    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=b76jvbahyj]{color:#4c4c4c} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=b76jvbahyj]{color:#b3b3b3}[data-colorid=qdnq2cfjku]{color:#4c4c4c} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=qdnq2cfjku]{color:#b3b3b3}[data-colorid=ijbcwvzag9]{color:#4c4c4c} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=ijbcwvzag9]{color:#b3b3b3}[data-colorid=icsbc8zcjz]{color:#4c4c4c} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=icsbc8zcjz]{color:#b3b3b3}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p>This page describes Odoo inventory relevant setup and configuration, following which you can effectively manage inventory integrated with Bahmni Clinical features.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h1 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-Warehouse&amp;Locations\">Warehouse &amp; Locations</h1><p>In Odoo 16, Storage Location tracking needs to be enabled. The same can be enabled or disabled from <code>Menu -&gt; Settings -&gt; Inventory -&gt; Warehouse</code>. In the screen enable the Storage Locations toggle to track stock by locations.</p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-155927.png\" width=\"871\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-155927.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478375162&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=871&amp;height=331\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/image-20240812-155927.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478375162&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"682\" data-width=\"1792\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690463237\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-155927.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"095860c7-745f-40cc-9fb5-36181f70f7d4\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-155927.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478375162&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=487 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-155927.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478375162&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=871&amp;height=331 1x\" /></span><p /><div class=\"expand-container conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a2a0aacb-6fc0-4972-8ee8-bfe04f5f6fec\" data-macro-name=\"expand\" id=\"expander-1656272683\"><div id=\"expander-control-1656272683\" class=\"expand-control\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">Odoo 10 Warehouse and Location Configuration</span></div><div id=\"expander-content-1656272683\" class=\"expand-content expand-hidden\"><p>Go to &quot;Menu / Inventory / Configuration / Settings&quot;, and find setting for &ldquo;Location &amp; Warehouse&rdquo;. Check for configuration element <strong>&quot;Warehouses and Locations usage level&quot;</strong> and choose your option.</p><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Manage only 1 Warehouse with only 1 stock location - this is the simplest of setup</p></li><li><p>Manage only 1 Warehouse, composed by several stock locations - our examples in WIKI, assumes such a setup.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Manage several Warehouses, each one composed by several stock locations -&nbsp;for advanced and more complicated setup. </p></li></ol><p>If you have chosen multiple warehouse/locations, you should see it reflect under your &ldquo;Inventory&rdquo; landing page.&nbsp;</p></div></div><p /><p>You can define different &ldquo;Internal&rdquo;&nbsp;inventory locations like &quot;Main Stock Room&quot;, &ldquo;OPD Pharmacy&rdquo;, &ldquo;IPD Pharmacy&rdquo;, &ldquo;Procedure Room&rdquo;, &quot;Samples Stock&quot; under the a warehouse<strong>. </strong>So the hierarchy may be</p><ul><li><p>WH (Warehouse Name)</p><ul><li><p>WH/Stock = the main stock room (this would be created by default, usually).&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>WH/OPD&nbsp;Pharmacy&nbsp; &nbsp;= OPD Pharmacy stock room</p></li><li><p>WH/IPD&nbsp;Pharmacy&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= IPD Pharmacy stock room</p></li><li><p>WH/Procedure Room = Surgery Stock Room</p></li><li><p>WH/Samples Stock&nbsp; &nbsp; = Maybe Doctor's received samples stock room where doctors may give away meds at his/her discretion.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>You can setup Warehouses and Locations by accessing configuration of Inventory module at <code>Menu -&gt; Inventory -&gt; Configuration</code></p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-160048.png\" width=\"871\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160048.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478453447&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=871&amp;height=170\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/image-20240812-160048.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478453447&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"351\" data-width=\"1792\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690594307\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-160048.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"4b3c9a91-12c5-4e63-b9fe-0d1981bab935\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160048.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478453447&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=251 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160048.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478453447&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=871&amp;height=170 1x\" /></span><p /><h1 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-ProductRelevantConfiguration\">Product Relevant Configuration</h1><p><span data-colorid=\"b76jvbahyj\">Go to &quot;Menu / Inventory / Configuration / Settings&quot;. The most relevant configurations are described below, but you should review other configuration elements that might apply for your implementation</span></p><h2 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-TraceabilitySettings\"><span data-colorid=\"ijbcwvzag9\">Traceability Settings</span></h2><ul><li><p>Enable&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;Track lots or serial numbers&rdquo;. </strong>This will enable product tracking by lot or serial number, which is relevant for medications or other consumables. Note: You may still decide to have &ldquo;no tracking&rdquo; (by lots/serial number) at individual product level.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Enable <strong>&ldquo;Expiration Dates&rdquo; </strong>to specify expiration for each serial numbers</p></li></ul><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-160149.png\" width=\"847\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160149.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478513873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=847&amp;height=130\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/image-20240812-160149.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478513873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"276\" data-width=\"1792\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690659852\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-160149.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"15a8e764-4e96-43c3-b28b-b639d85aec83\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160149.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478513873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=197 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160149.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478513873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=847&amp;height=130 1x\" /></span><p /><h2 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-ProductsSettings\">Products&nbsp;<span data-colorid=\"icsbc8zcjz\">Settings</span></h2><ul><li><p><strong>&ldquo;Units of Measure&rdquo; :</strong>&nbsp;Choose &ldquo;Some products may be sold/purchased in different units of measure (advanced)&rdquo;.&nbsp; </p><ul><li><p>You should be able to see some predefined &ldquo;Units of Measure&rdquo; already present under &quot;Configuration / Units of measure&quot; menu.&nbsp;</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>&quot;Product Variants&quot;: </strong>choose option &quot;No variants&quot; or &quot;<span data-colorid=\"qdnq2cfjku\">Products can have several attributes, defining variants&quot; as applicable.</span></p></li></ul><h2 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-ProductCategories\">Product Categories</h2><p>Go to &quot;Menu / Inventory / Configuration / Products / Product Categories&quot;.</p><ul><li><p>You should see some predefined category hierarchy. for example: you may want to create a category called &ldquo;Fees and Charges&rdquo; under &ldquo;All / Services&rdquo; for any type of Service that you may define, like Specialist Fee, Minor Dressing Fee etc.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>You may also want to re-organize the product categories in hierarchies. Typically, the product categories are hierarchized as &quot;All / Saleable&quot; and &quot;All / Services&quot;. Your category hierarchy may look like below&nbsp;</p></li></ul><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-160437.png\" width=\"587\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160437.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478682329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=587&amp;height=884\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/image-20240812-160437.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478682329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"885\" data-width=\"587\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690430467\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-160437.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"6eed07e8-7545-4108-959d-d21c5287b932\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160437.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478682329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=849&amp;height=1280 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/image-20240812-160437.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478682329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=587&amp;height=884 1x\" /></span><h2 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-IndividualProductSpecification\">Individual Product Specification</h2><p>Once the products are synchronized from OpenMRS, you may want to configure each products.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Go to &ldquo;Menu / Inventory / Products&rdquo; and search for a product and edit. e.g &ldquo;Ibuprofen 400mg&rdquo;</p><ul><li><p>Usually, Drugs etc will be synced as product type &ldquo;Saleable Product&rdquo; that can be stocked, and Lab tests/Radiology tests etc will be synced as &ldquo;Service&rdquo;.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>In &ldquo;General information&rdquo; tab, configure properties like &ldquo;Sales Price&rdquo;, &ldquo;Cost Price&rdquo;, &ldquo;MRP&rdquo;, &ldquo;Units of Measure&rdquo; etc</p></li><li><p>In &ldquo;Inventory&rdquo; tab, configure properties like Routes (Buy or Make to order), tracking options (No tracking, by serial number, by lots&rdquo;, vendors for this product etc (especially for stockable product)</p></li></ul><p>NOTE: Tracking options are important, especially if you are managing purchases through Odoo and dispensing drugs by lots or serial number.&nbsp;</p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"871\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/Screenshot%202024-08-12%20at%209.35.23%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478786810&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=871&amp;height=589\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/Screenshot%202024-08-12%20at%209.35.23%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478786810&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"762\" data-width=\"1126\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3689742341\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot 2024-08-12 at 9.35.23 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"789d9af3-cff3-4f53-be6f-7cb77ea0de87\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/Screenshot%202024-08-12%20at%209.35.23%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478786810&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=866 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/Screenshot%202024-08-12%20at%209.35.23%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723478786810&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=871&amp;height=589 1x\" /></span><p /><h1 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-CustomizeProductLots/Seriallistview(onlyforOdoo10)\">Customize Product Lots/Serial list view (only for Odoo 10)</h1><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998DD9;border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: #EAE6FF;\">\n<p>This is needed only in Odoo 10. Odoo 16 comes preconfigured with this extension fields displayed.</p>\n</div></div><p>If you have enabled product tracking by &ldquo;lots/serial number&rdquo;, and you follow a purchase/receive process for that product, you can define sale price for each lot while receiving the products.&nbsp;</p><p>List of lots/serial information can be viewed form &ldquo;Menu / Inventory / Inventory Control / Lots/Serial Number&rdquo;. By default the screen shows up with a table showing fields - &ldquo;lot/serial number&rdquo;, &ldquo;reference&rdquo;, &ldquo;product&rdquo;.&nbsp;</p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"680\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/Odoo_default_Lots_Serial_View.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365060919&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=680&amp;height=132\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/Odoo_default_Lots_Serial_View.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365060919&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"452\" data-width=\"2324\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"904167808\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_default_Lots_Serial_View.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"994827bf-b572-4c03-a461-a7e2e0f7b865\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/Odoo_default_Lots_Serial_View.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365060919&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1360&amp;height=264 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900530225/Odoo_default_Lots_Serial_View.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365060919&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=680&amp;height=132 1x\" /></span><p /><p>If you would like to see fields like &ldquo;cost price&rdquo;, &ldquo;sale price&rdquo; and &ldquo;expiry date&rdquo;, you need to customize the odoo default view. To do this see follow instructions below</p><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Enable developer mode</p></li><li><p>Go to&ldquo;Menu / Inventory / Inventory Control / Lots/Serial Number&rdquo;, and from Odoo developer tools (top right corner), select &ldquo;edit treeview&rdquo;, edit the XML view definition and add the following fields.&nbsp;</p><p /><p><strong>Losts TreeView</strong></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ce140b1b-298b-40a7-be16-06bd5b9c4e05\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: text; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">    ....\n    &lt;field name=&quot;cost_price&quot;/&gt;\n    &lt;field name=&quot;sale_price&quot;/&gt;\n    &lt;field name=&quot;life_date&quot;/&gt;</pre>\n</div></div><p /></li><li><p>Save and reload the page. You should see the view like below with additional columns</p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/Odoo_customized_Lots_Serial_View.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365403253&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900530225/Odoo_customized_Lots_Serial_View.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365403253&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"466\" data-width=\"2346\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"904560690\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_customized_Lots_Serial_View.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"71d04a56-9d7e-411b-9bf7-45e3827443bf\" data-media-type=\"file\" /></span></li></ol></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p /><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9550b5b8-4445-4cfa-91cc-fcc181bc5543\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><h3 id=\"OdooInventoryConfiguration-OnthisPage\">On this Page</h3></div></div><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"default\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"36a14b24-f633-4515-b391-b68b3496853e\" data-macro-id=\"704a085e-9e1b-4ca9-8d30-19a041972b88\" data-macro-name=\"toc\" data-numberedoutline=\"false\" data-structure=\"list\"> </div><p /><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"d2189dde-1689-463c-b589-3d27460f5d37\" data-macro-id=\"93152c5d-6bea-40d9-a973-a55a64c04d31\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9KPeGFyWa18\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odoo Inventory, Warehouse Management</a> (Odoo webinar)</p><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zj8_8Uh3EAo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory 10 Management, Products</a> (Odoo webinar)</p><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.odoo.com/documentation/16.0/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odoo 16 Inventory Management</a> (Official Docs)</p>\n</div></div><p /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
